  "description": "Jae-Hui luckily lands a job at a major corporation's design team. Jung-Hun, a fellow employee, was everyone's favorite for his handsome looks and friendly personality. Jae-Hui, too, found himself attracted to Jung-Hun, who was close to his ideal type. However, soon after, Jae-Hui witnessed Jung-Hun gossiping about him. Instead, he shamelessly confronts Jung-Hun, and decides to test him with a bold proposal. Jung-Hun unexpectedly offers Jae-Hui an unexpected answer. Instead, Jae-Hui finds himself swayed by Jung-Hun...\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
